    <briefdescription>
<para>Base struct for all pose types in <ref refid="namespaceILLIXR" kindref="compound">ILLIXR</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Captures the common 6-DOF pose fields (position, orientation) together with the metadata that every derived pose needs: confidence, and validity. Derived structs should inherit from this type rather than duplicating these fields. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
